007400*************************************************************
007500**                                                         **
007600**          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
007700**                                                         **
007800*************************************************************
007900**#########################################################**
008000*************************************************************
008100
008200
008300 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CCODECHK-PARMS.
008400
008500 BEGIN-HERE.
008600     MOVE SPACES TO CODE-CHK-FLAG.
008700     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
008800     GOBACK.
008900
009000 6-MAIN.
009100     MOVE PLANT-CHK TO WHICH-PLANT.
009200
009300     IF STAND-ALONE-PLANT
009400       MOVE "P" TO CODE-CHK-FLAG
009500     ELSE
009600       IF  ((CODE-CHK-5 IS NUMERIC OR CODE-CHK-5 = SPACE)
009700        AND (CODE-CHK-6 IS NUMERIC OR CODE-CHK-6 = SPACE)
009800        AND (CODE-CHK-7 IS NUMERIC OR CODE-CHK-7 = SPACE))
009900           MOVE "C" TO CODE-CHK-FLAG
010000       ELSE
010100           MOVE "P" TO CODE-CHK-FLAG.
010200
010300 6-MAIN-X.
010400     EXIT.
